{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New VR Movie-Watching Experience! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CinemaLandVR presents over 200 architectural modules and furniture pieces, enabling you to craft a uniquely personalized viewing environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/0f2e974b00baa0abc9a5c4344f564fea.avif?t=1772626231\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer co-op: Build a cinema together with friends.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR and non-VR players can join the same session \u2014 non-VR players enter as drones, offering a distinct control scheme and perspective. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.poster.avif?t=1772626231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.webm?t=1772626231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.mp4?t=1772626231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player have the option to browse local videos or stream online content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With virtual reality technology, you can dive into a cinematic big-screen experience right within the villa you've crafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online videos now support automatic parsing of Bilibili and YouTube \u2014 just copy the website URL to play the video.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.poster.avif?t=1772626231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.webm?t=1772626231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.mp4?t=1772626231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch movies together with friends in real time via synchronized online streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2c17c2245b63e33abeb1b25b32272fca.poster.avif?t=1772626231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2c17c2245b63e33abeb1b25b32272fca.webm?t=1772626231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/2c17c2245b63e33abeb1b25b32272fca.mp4?t=1772626231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Character Customization  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports full character customization, allowing you to create your own unique virtual avatar through intuitive, one-click adjustments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/b9faebcf1cbd06c9d0a033d7dcf68424.poster.avif?t=1772626231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/b9faebcf1cbd06c9d0a033d7dcf68424.webm?t=1772626231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/b9faebcf1cbd06c9d0a033d7dcf68424.mp4?t=1772626231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Craft Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3831090/e7652806f7b8da4d6e323d61eec9d989f2facede.jpg"},{"name":"Save Your World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3831090/3a18286e782e7cd057e0d89db103a67087f2bbb5.jpg"},{"name":"Environmental Adjuster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3831090/c1251873c7633fefc2bb98188ef3baf85615c8be.jpg"},{"name":"World Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3831090/30528941980ca4c9ee68f4a324fc60c6c539f9fa.jpg"},{"name":"Apprentice Engineer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3831090/21b9b450f1dc488ac0ae756f2738e53ddc32d3eb.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831090?t=1772626231","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3831090?t=1772626231","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/1be0be31117d9f09bb4176a5d5c645403e6f7d37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772626231","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/1be0be31117d9f09bb4176a5d5c645403e6f7d37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772626231","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A New VR Movie-Watching Experience! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CinemaLandVR presents over 200 architectural modules and furniture pieces, enabling you to craft a uniquely personalized viewing environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/0f2e974b00baa0abc9a5c4344f564fea.avif?t=1772626231\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer co-op: Build a cinema together with friends.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR and non-VR players can join the same session \u2014 non-VR players enter as drones, offering a distinct control scheme and perspective. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.poster.avif?t=1772626231\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.webm?t=1772626231\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/03f192ab8920b0873b26a7427458f969.mp4?t=1772626231\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player have the option to browse local videos or stream online content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > With virtual reality technology, you can dive into a cinematic big-screen experience right within the villa you've crafted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online videos now support automatic parsing of Bilibili and YouTube \u2014 just copy the website URL to play the video.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3831090/extras/14a21fdff7952499bcabf6980cab30c7.poster.avif?t=1